{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_savvi_backend", "label": "Savvi Backend (README)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L1-L184", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "API REST de Savvi: autenticaci\u00f3n JWT, cuentas, presupuestos, transacciones, planificador de pagos y almacenamiento de archivos en AWS S3."}, {"id": "readme_nestjs_framework", "label": "NestJS 11 Framework", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L3-L12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Framework de la API sobre Node.js 22."}, {"id": "readme_typeorm_postgresql", "label": "TypeORM over PostgreSQL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L3-L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ORM y motor de base de datos; las entidades son la fuente de verdad desde la que se generan las migraciones."}, {"id": "readme_jwt_passport_auth", "label": "JWT Authentication with Passport", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L11-L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "readme_aws_s3_storage", "label": "AWS S3 Storage with Presigned URLs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L11-L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Almacenamiento de archivos v\u00eda URLs prefirmadas; requiere AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, AWS_REGION y AWS_S3_BUCKET."}, {"id": "readme_swagger_openapi_docs", "label": "Swagger / OpenAPI Documentation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L12-L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Documentaci\u00f3n viva expuesta en /docs; es la referencia can\u00f3nica de schemas a la que FRONT.md delega el detalle."}, {"id": "readme_environment_variables", "label": "Environment Variables (.env)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L20-L41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PORT, credenciales de PostgreSQL y de AWS S3. El .env est\u00e1 excluido de Git y de la imagen Docker y nunca se sube al repositorio."}, {"id": "readme_database_migrations", "label": "TypeORM Migrations Workflow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L59-L65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "migration:generate deriva la migraci\u00f3n de las entidades; run/revert aplican o revierten. Se prefiere migraciones expl\u00edcitas sobre synchronize autom\u00e1tico."}, {"id": "readme_deterministic_seeder", "label": "Deterministic Example Data Seeder", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L67-L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "~5.100 registros con 5 perfiles de usuario y ~24 meses de datos coherentes. Determinista: la misma semilla produce siempre los mismos datos. Repetible: borra solo los usuarios del dominio @savvi.demo de la corrida anterior para no duplicar, sin tocar el resto de la base salvo con --purge. Los adjuntos sembrados son registros en documents sin archivo real en S3, as\u00ed que la descarga prefirmada responde 404."}, {"id": "readme_register_paths_alias_loader", "label": "register-paths.js Path Alias Loader", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L94-L104", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El build compila TypeScript a dist/ pero los alias de rutas no se resuelven en runtime, por eso producci\u00f3n arranca con node -r ./register-paths.js dist/main.js."}, {"id": "readme_docker_multistage_image", "label": "Multi-stage Docker Image", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L106-L123", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Imagen multi-stage (build + runtime) sobre node:22-alpine, corriendo como usuario sin privilegios y con tini como init para manejar se\u00f1ales y zombies. El .dockerignore evita copiar node_modules, .env y dumps a la imagen."}, {"id": "readme_container_rebuild_policy", "label": "Container Rebuild vs Recreate Policy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L125-L154", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Las variables de entorno se leen al arrancar el contenedor, no en caliente: si solo cambi\u00f3 el .env basta recrear el contenedor; si cambi\u00f3 c\u00f3digo, dependencias o Dockerfile hay que reconstruir la imagen. Las migraciones se ejecutan dentro del contenedor en marcha con docker exec."}, {"id": "readme_test_suites", "label": "Test Suites (unit / e2e / coverage)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L156-L162", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "readme_module_structure", "label": "Feature-Module Source Structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L164-L183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un directorio por dominio (auth, accounts, categories, budgets, transactions, payment-planner, transfer-templates, waitinglist, s3, ai-register) m\u00e1s config, seeds, infrastructure y migrations; cada m\u00f3dulo mapea 1:1 con un grupo de endpoints de FRONT.md."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_savvi_backend", "target": "readme_nestjs_framework", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file"